# Knight of Grace has hexproof from black and gets +1/+0 as long as any player controls a black permanent; Knight of
# Malice has hexproof from white and gets +1/+0 for a white permanent. Side by side each pumps the other: both 3/2.
# Bot2's Fatal Push (black) can't target Knight of Grace (CR 702.11d) but can target Knight of Malice, which dies; with
# no black permanent left, Knight of Grace is 2/2 again. Bot2's Lightning Bolt (red) then targets and kills Knight of
# Grace: hexproof from black is no hexproof from red.

